tilities, infrastructure, energy, and other mission-critical environments."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Increased operational efficiency","Improved process consistency","Reduced manual intervention","Real-time operational visibility","Faster fault detection","Scalable industrial architecture","Simplified system management","Enhanced operational reliability"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Automation Control Portfolio"},{"t":"p","html":"Our automation portfolio includes industrial controllers, PLC systems, HMI interfaces, SCADA platforms, distributed control systems (DCS), industrial networking equipment, I/O modules, sensors, drives, and control accessories that support reliable automation across industrial environments."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512.016 512.016\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path d=\"M463.295 76.593a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-9.736-11.411l-16.191 13.813a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 9.736 11.411zM430.592 231.665v9.229c0 4.142 3.357 7.5 7.5 7.5s7.5-3.358 7.5-7.5v-9.229c0-4.142-3.357-7.5-7.5-7.5s-7.5 3.358-7.5 7.5M51.393 386.588c-7.811 7.812-7.811 20.521 0 28.334 7.829 7.829 20.504 7.832 28.335-.001 7.811-7.812 7.811-20.521 0-28.333-7.83-7.83-20.505-7.831-28.335 0m17.727 17.726a5.03 5.03 0 0 1-7.12.001 5.04 5.04 0 0 1 0-7.12 5.03 5.03 0 0 1 7.12 0 5.04 5.04 0 0 1 0 7.119M138.514 356.134c7.831-7.831 7.832-20.503.001-28.334s-20.503-7.831-28.334 0-7.83 20.502 0 28.334c7.829 7.829 20.502 7.831 28.333 0m-17.726-17.727a5.03 5.03 0 0 1 7.119-.001v.001a5.03 5.03 0 0 1 0 7.12 5.03 5.03 0 0 1-7.12-.001 5.03 5.03 0 0 1 .001-7.119M86.432 361.376a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-.001 10.606l7.9 7.901a7.48 7.48 0 0 0 5.304 2.197 7.498 7.498 0